  "body": "Currently two subtests are failing in relevant-mutations.html for WebKit:\r\nhttps://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-img-element/relevant-mutations.html?label=experimental&label=master&aligned&view=subtest \r\n\r\nThese two also happen to fail in chromium and I verified it would be easy to fix. However, do people\r\nthink the two subtests are correct or not? I talked with Anne and he leans towards the two subtests not being\r\naccording to spec, in which case we should fix the test...",
